licy and IAM roles for secure document handling, 4) Prepare a security checklist covering HTTPS, CSP headers, backup procedures, and audit logging. Include step-by-step instructions for the invitation-based user registration process.\\\"\\n}\\n###SEC_IMPL_001###\"}]}],\"config\":{},\"tools\":[],\"output\":{}}}","genkit:state":"success"},"displayName":"generate","links":[],"instrumentationLibrary":{"name":"genkit-tracer","version":"v1"},"spanKind":"INTERNAL","sameProcessAsParentSpan":{"value":true},"status":{"code":0},"timeEvents":{"timeEvent":[]}}},"displayName":"generate","startTime":1753486047146,"endTime":1753486165113.5254}